    {
      "id": "6gWkLipEzVUT8WmawEQwi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -893.6713810530664,
      "y": 48.857066078936214,
      "width": 648.5795288085938,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1040300346,
      "version": 349,
      "versionNonce": 543914234,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793900354045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When sale comes in from affiliate network\n1. What store was this\n2. Who owns it? (account)\n3. What rate applies\n\n\nnormalized retailer answes this\n\nRevenue comes in with base programId from that affiliaten etwork\nRevenue can be unmapped in practice",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When sale comes in from affiliate network\n1. What store was this\n2. Who owns it? (account)\n3. What rate applies\n\n\nnormalized retailer answes this\n\nRevenue comes in with base programId from that affiliaten etwork\nRevenue can be unmapped in practice",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TNBClcB3TEhXREykPJIxJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -263.66468811035156,
      "y": -305.1748046875,
      "width": 2660.538330078125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1766864550,
      "version": 845,
      "versionNonce": 155958694,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793899839372,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Does a D2C site need a designation to be a destination? No, there are two routes a URL can take through classifier\n\nRetailer route\n1. The URL's host is matched against every designation's hostFilter (walmart quince drybar recognized. QUince and NBC needed own designation because they are websites that publishers link to and the publisher has no claim on that site. We had to make the host known.\n2. Storefront route, the classifier reads account's designation.d2c snapshot which holds deeplink domains of every program the brand has activity bound, it gets classified under generic D2C designation\n\nBrand that has claimed its Impact program can already send traffic to its own site, and the link is rewritten through the house Impact credential. Claimed brand cannot have products on that site. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Does a D2C site need a designation to be a destination? No, there are two routes a URL can take through classifier\n\nRetailer route\n1. The URL's host is matched against every designation's hostFilter (walmart quince drybar recognized. QUince and NBC needed own designation because they are websites that publishers link to and the publisher has no claim on that site. We had to make the host known.\n2. Storefront route, the classifier reads account's designation.d2c snapshot which holds deeplink domains of every program the brand has activity bound, it gets classified under generic D2C designation\n\nBrand that has claimed its Impact program can already send traffic to its own site, and the link is rewritten through the house Impact credential. Claimed brand cannot have products on that site. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RxvTJ6qmYkF_D6JX5g6_C",
